<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('head', { title: 'Learn chess', description: 'Build your chess confidence with Queen’s Chess Club. Discover coaching topics, meet fellow players, and join our Thursday club nights.' }) %></head>
<body class="site-page">
<%- include('header') %>
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="site-shell page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A little curiosity goes a long way</p><h1>Every master was<br>once a beginner.</h1><p>Learn the rules, spot your first tactic, or work on your next breakthrough. You’ve got people to learn with.</p></section>
  <section class="site-shell learning-layout">
    <div><h2>Let’s work on your game.</h2><p>Our club brings beginners and experienced players together to share ideas, discuss games, and get better at chess. You don’t need a rating or a perfect opening repertoire to get started.</p><p>We’ve also offered free, drop-in coaching covering everything from opening principles to attacking play. Join Discord for announcements about future coaching sessions.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= club.discord %>">Ask about coaching <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <aside class="learning-aside"><p class="eyebrow">Start with a club night</p><h2>A friendly place to learn.</h2><p><strong><%= club.meeting.day %> · <%= club.meeting.time %></strong><br><%= club.meeting.location %></p><p>Introduce yourself and let us know what you’d like to learn. Check Discord for coaching times and weekly updates.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#visit">Plan your first visit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">From our coaching program</p><h2 id="topics-title">Build your chess toolkit.</h2></div><p>Topics from previous sessions.<br>Future session dates will be announced on Discord.</p></div>
    <div class="topic-grid">
      <% const topics = [ ['Opening principles', 'Develop your pieces, control the centre, and give your king a safe home.'], ['Thinking like a player', 'Learn how stronger players evaluate a position and choose their next move.'], ['Tactics & calculation', 'Look for forcing moves, coordinate your pieces, and spot opportunities.'], ['Strategy & planning', 'Understand piece activity, prevent threats, and build a practical plan.'], ['Attacking play', 'Create an attack with purpose and recognise when the position calls for one.'], ['Into the endgame', 'Explore the transition from a busy middlegame to the final few pieces.'] ]; %>
      <% topics.forEach((topic, index) => { %><article class="topic-card"><span>0<%= index + 1 %></span><h3><%= topic[0] %></h3><p><%= topic[1] %></p></article><% }) %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell events-meeting coaching-feedback"><div><p class="eyebrow">Help shape the next session</p><h2>What would you like to learn?</h2><p>Tell our coaches which parts of your game you want to work on.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="https://forms.gle/oVi4WKSwnRvAxiAm7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share your interests <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</main>
<%- include('footer') %>
</body>
</html>
